#################################################################
Q: Can you reverse the array without using another array?

Yes. The above solution uses only one temporary variable, so:
Time  : O(n)
Space : O(1)

Q: Can you do this using pointers instead of arr[i]?
Yes:
void reverse_array(int *arr, int n)
{
    int *start = arr;
    int *end = arr + n - 1;
    int temp;

    while (start < end)
    {
        temp = *start;
        *start = *end;
        *end = temp;

        start++;
        end--;
    }
}
